WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.365
<c.caption-en>Guide 4. Give your workbook a home on the laptop.</c>
<c.caption-zh>指南 4：在电脑上为工作簿找个保存位置。</c>

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:10.190
<c.caption-en>Before we change anything, I want you to check two things: your file name and where your workbook is saved.</c>
<c.caption-zh>修改前先检查两件事：文件名，以及工作簿保存在哪里。</c>

00:00:10.205 --> 00:00:17.535
<c.caption-en>If this is already your own Teams copy, don't make another copy. Just check its name and location.</c>
<c.caption-zh>如果已经是你的 Teams 个人副本，就不要再复制，只需检查名称和位置。</c>

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:22.985
<c.caption-en>For a shared or downloaded starter, we'll make your own named copy. Watch how I do this in Excel for the web.</c>
<c.caption-zh>如果是共享或下载的起始文件，就创建自己的命名副本。看老师在网页版 Excel 中演示。</c>

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.065
<c.caption-en>I open File, choose Create a Copy, and then Create a copy online.</c>
<c.caption-zh>打开 File，选择 Create a Copy，再选择 Create a copy online。</c>

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:34.025
<c.caption-en>Now I'll give the workbook a clear name. My example</c>
<c.caption-zh>现在给工作簿起一个清楚的名称。这个例子</c>

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:40.930
<c.caption-en>uses 7T_Aisha_EcoBudget_v1.</c>
<c.caption-zh>使用 7T_Aisha_EcoBudget_v1。</c>

00:00:40.945 --> 00:00:43.870
<c.caption-en>Use your own class and name, not Aisha.</c>
<c.caption-zh>请使用自己的班级和姓名，不要写 Aisha。</c>

00:00:43.885 --> 00:00:49.505
<c.caption-en>Next, I'll choose my school OneDrive and the Computing folder. I'll complete the copy</c>
<c.caption-zh>接着选择学校 OneDrive 中的 Computing 文件夹，完成复制，</c>

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:54.335
<c.caption-en>and check the new file name. This is the workbook I'll use for the rest of the lesson.</c>
<c.caption-zh>再检查新文件名。这就是本节课接下来要用的工作簿。</c>

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:59.695
<c.caption-en>Now it's your turn. Check that you have one named working copy in school OneDrive,</c>
<c.caption-zh>现在轮到你。检查学校 OneDrive 中有一份正确命名的工作副本，</c>

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:03.245
<c.caption-en>not only in Downloads. Then return to the lesson web page.</c>
<c.caption-zh>不能只保存在 Downloads。然后返回课程网页。</c>
